{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>אֲשֶׁר הִצִּיל וגו׳ לָנוּ וגו׳.</b> Meaning: HaShem rescued our property — that which he was obligated to give us from his hand — for the language of rescue (הַצָּלָה) is used of rescuing stolen property from a robber. And His saying <b>לָנוּ</b> means: from what is ours, that he had stolen."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:13.084009878Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}